es."]}]]}]]}],["$","p","paragraph-5",{"children":["According to HPD policy, “property owners of residential buildings are required by law to register annually with HPD if the property is a multiple dwelling (3+ residential units) or a private dwelling (1–2 residential units) where neither the owner nor the owner’s immediate family resides.” This data must be made publicly available according to ",["$","a","hyperlink-1",{"href":"https://opendata.cityofnewyork.us/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["NYC’s Open Data law"]}],"."]}],["$","p","paragraph-6",{"children":[["$","strong","text-0,bold-0",{"children":"HPD updates this registration data (which updates live on this site) monthly."}]," We also use datasets from the following sources to provide additional information:"]}],["$","ul","unordered-list-7",{"children":[["$","li","list-item-0",{"children":[["$","p","paragraph-0",{"children":[["$","strong","text-0,bold-0",{"children":"HPD complaints "}],"from ",["$","a","hyperlink-2",{"href":"https://data.cityofnewyork.us/Housing-Development/Housing-Maintenance-Code-Complaints/uwyv-629c","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["NYC Open Data"]}]," — ",["$","em","text-4,italic-0",{"children":"updated monthly"}]]}]]}],["$","li","list-item-1",{"children":[["$","p","paragraph-0",{"children":[["$","strong","text-0,bold-0",{"children":"DOB job application filings "}],"from ",["$","a","hyperlink-2",{"href":"https://data.cityofnewyork.us/Housing-Development/DOB-Job-Application-Filings/ic3t-wcy2","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["NYC Open Data"]}]," — ",["$","em","text-4,italic-0",{"children":"updated daily"}]]}]]}],["$","li","list-item-2",{"children":[["$","p","paragraph-0",{"children":[["$","strong","text-0,bold-0",{"children":"Primary Land Use Tax Lot data (\"PLUTO\")"}]," from ",["$","a","hyperlink-2",{"href":"https://www1.nyc.gov/site/planning/data-maps/open-data.page","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["NYC Dept. of City Planning"]}]," — ","$L2"]}]]}],"$L3","$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7"]}],"$L8"]}]]}],null,"$L9"]}],"loading":null,"isPartial":false}
